#   ./m3tal-lm chatdata split --in data/chat-custom.jsonl --out-dir /tmp/custom-split

{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What is M3TAL?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"M3TAL is a local-first infrastructure management suite. Its core engine exposes a tool API for stacks, containers, services, and logs, and the m3tal-ai assistant routes requests to those tools deterministically."}],"category":"ops-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"How do I check the health of my M3TAL deployment?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Use the health tool through the assistant or Core API to get component status. For a quick check, ask: 'check system health' and the planner will route to the health tool."}],"category":"ops-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"How do I restart a container named web?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Ask the assistant to restart the container 'web', or call the restart_container tool with target 'web'. Confirm the action when prompted."}],"category":"ops-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What stacks are currently running?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The containers tool lists running stacks and containers. Ask 'list containers' or 'show stacks' and the assistant will query Core for live state."}],"category":"ops-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Where are the M3TAL logs?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Component logs are available through the logs tool. Ask 'show logs for <component>' and the assistant fetches them from Core."}],"category":"ops-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a concise assistant. Answer in one or two sentences."},{"role":"user","content":"What is Docker?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Docker is a platform for building, shipping, and running applications in lightweight containers."}],"category":"general-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a concise assistant. Answer in one or two sentences."},{"role":"user","content":"What is a GPU?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"A GPU is a processor specialized for parallel math, originally for graphics, now widely used for machine learning and rendering."}],"category":"general-qa"}
{"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a concise assistant. Answer in one or two sentences."},{"role":"user","content":"What is version control?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Version control tracks changes to files over time so you can review, revert, and collaborate. Git is the most common system."}],"category":"general-qa"}
